                "quote": "| RenewalsBlocked(MemberId m, owed) -> $\"member {m} owes {money owed}; renewals are blocked until it is below 5.00\""
              }
            ],
            "rationale": "The blocking threshold has an authoritative definition in Policy.blockingBalance, which Accounts.isBlocked uses. The change set also hard-codes the literal 5.00 three times in Tier 3 message text instead of taking it from Policy or from the error value. The copies agree with the policy today, but they would drift if the threshold changed. That is one fact restated.",
